### Sonde de vivacité
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

> {%
  client.test("health is ok", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "expected 200");
    client.assert(response.body.status === "ok", "expected status ok");
  });
%}

### Sonde de disponibilité (base et listener daemon)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ready
Accept: application/json

> {%
  client.test("instance is ready", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "expected 200");
    client.assert(response.body.status === "ready", "expected status ready");
  });
%}

### Document OpenAPI (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/openapi.json
Accept: application/json
